2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.927983 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:58 ==========================================================
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.927986 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:59 *** INFRASTRUCTURE LIMITATION ANALYSIS                  ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.927990 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:60 ==========================================================
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.927994 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:62 --- LIMIT-1: Frequency Hopping (FH) not supported ---
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.927997 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:63 *** The spec's IdleUpdated preamble at line [3] uses    ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928001 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:64 *** C_Test_fh (frequency hopping cell configuration).   ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928004 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:65 *** osmo-virtphy (l1ctl_sap.c) contains:                ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928009 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:66 ***   OSMO_ASSERT(est_req->h == 0) /* no hopping */      ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928012 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:67 *** Any channel activation with h=1 (hopping) crashes   ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928016 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:68 *** the virtual PHY process immediately. The test       ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928020 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:69 *** cannot establish Cell A with FH, preventing the     ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928028 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:70 *** test from reaching the handover phase.              ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928032 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:72 --- LIMIT-2: Non-synchronised handover not supported ---
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928036 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:73 *** The test spec lines [4]-[9] configure 9 iterations  ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928040 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:74 *** of handover from Cell A to Cell B with:             ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928045 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:75 ***   +StartCellB_ho (line [4]): frame offset = 100     ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928048 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:76 ***   Synchi(C_not_report_otd, C_non_synchronised)      ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928052 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:77 *** Non-synchronized HO requires the MS to send access  ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928056 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:78 *** bursts (RACH) on the new channel until receiving    ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928061 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:79 *** PHYSICAL INFORMATION from the network.              ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928065 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:80 *** osmo-virtphy and osmo-bts-virtual have no mechanism ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928068 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:81 *** to simulate inter-cell handover with frame offset   ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928072 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:82 *** or to inject PHYSICAL INFORMATION messages via the  ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928076 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:83 *** MSC stub interface. The BSC manages handover        ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928081 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:84 *** internally; the MSC stub cannot trigger a true HO.  ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928084 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:86 --- LIMIT-3: RF Timing Measurement (Check_Time) not available ---
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928088 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:87 *** The test requires Check_Time() at line [112]:      ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928092 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:88 ***   local_firstburst_ontime_CHK sub-procedure uses   ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928096 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:89 ***   +FnArith(TCV_FnBurst, TCV_Strt.fn) to measure    ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928100 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:90 ***   the time difference between the first HO access  ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928104 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:91 ***   burst and the commanded starting time.           ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928107 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:92 *** Lines [715], [734]: Verdict FAIL if timing error   ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928111 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:93 ***   exceeds tolerance (5ms for TCH/F, 10ms for TCH/H) ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928115 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:94 *** GSMTAP packet timestamps are not frame-accurate;   ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928119 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:95 *** the virtual PHY has no real TDMA frame clock.      ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928122 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:96 *** Sub-millisecond timing measurements are impossible ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928125 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:97 *** in the GSMTAP-only virtual test environment.       ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928129 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:99 --- LIMIT-4: Multi-cell environment not available ---
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928132 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:100 *** The test uses +StartCellB_ho (line [4]) to start   ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928136 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:101 *** a second cell (Cell B) with a frame offset of 100  ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928140 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:102 *** frames relative to Cell A. The test then performs  ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928144 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:103 *** 9 handover iterations between the two cells.       ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928147 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:104 *** The current osmo-bts-virtual + osmo-virtphy setup  ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928152 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:105 *** supports only a single virtual cell. Simulating    ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928156 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:106 *** handover between two cells with different BCCHs    ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928160 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:107 *** and frame clocks requires multi-BTS infrastructure ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928165 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:108 *** that is not available in the current test network. ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928171 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:110 ==========================================================
